@page "/education"

<PageTitle>Education</PageTitle>

<section class="education-header">
	<p class="education-eyebrow">Learning and achievement</p>
	<h1>Education</h1>
	<p class="education-intro">A record of academic study, competitions, and the qualifications that have shaped my work.</p>
</section>

<section class="education-sections" aria-label="Education history">
	<details class="education-section" open>
		<summary>
			<span>Academic tests + competitions</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>These experiences have been some of the most fun and some of the most stressful exams I have ever undertaken 
                and have helped me develop my problem-solving skills and ability to work under pressure.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="Academic tests and competitions">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">TMUA</span><span role="cell">8.0</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">MAT</span><span role="cell">77</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">UKMT Senior Maths Challenge</span><span role="cell">Gold (Highest in School)</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">UKMT Senior Team Maths Challenge</span><span role="cell">Bronze</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">UK Bebras Elite Challenge</span><span role="cell">Gold</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>

	<details class="education-section">
		<summary>
			<span>University</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>Experiencing a world-class education at the University of Oxford has allowed me to truly deepen my understanding of Computer Science.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="University qualifications">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Preliminary exams</span><span role="cell">To be added</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>

	<details class="education-section">
		<summary>
			<span>A Level</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>A Level study allowed me to explore my interests in greater depth and rigor than GCSE and is where I grew to love my subject.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="A Level qualifications">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Computer Science</span><span role="cell">A*</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Further Mathematics</span><span role="cell">A*</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Mathematics</span><span role="cell">A*</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Physics</span><span role="cell">A*</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>

	<details class="education-section">
		<summary>
			<span>GCSE</span>
			<span class="summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
		</summary>
		<div class="education-section-content">
			<p>GCSE study established the basis for my academic journey.</p>
			<div class="qualification-table" role="table" aria-label="GCSE qualifications">
				<div class="qualification-row qualification-heading" role="row"><span role="columnheader">Certification</span><span role="columnheader">Grade</span></div>
				<div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Computer Science</span><span role="cell">9</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Further Mathematics</span><span role="cell">9</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Mathematics</span><span role="cell">9</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Physics</span><span role="cell">9</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Chemistry</span><span role="cell">9</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Biology</span><span role="cell">9</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">English Language</span><span role="cell">8</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">English Literature</span><span role="cell">6</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Geography</span><span role="cell">8</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Latin</span><span role="cell">7</span></div>
                <div class="qualification-row" role="row"><span role="cell">Classical Civilisation</span><span role="cell">6</span></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>
</section>